---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SelectedWork from '../components/SelectedWork.astro';
import '../styles/studio.css';
---
<Layout title="Fully Automated Enterprises — An independent AI studio" description="Local AI, useful tools, and machine-made media. An independent studio building things and inspecting how they work.">
<Navigation />
<main id="main-content">
<section class="studio-wrap hero">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Independent studio / Human-directed, machine-assisted</p><h1>Tools for thinking.<br/>Machines for <em>making.</em></h1><p class="hero-deck">Local AI, useful software, and machine-made media. A workshop for turning new capabilities into things worth using.</p><a class="text-link" href="#selected-work">Explore the work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
  <figure class="hero-plate"><img src="/studio-plate.svg" width="640" height="620" alt="Original studio illustration: connected rings, signals, and a human in the loop."/><figcaption>Fig. 01 — An instrument, not an autopilot.</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<section class="studio-wrap lanes" aria-label="Studio disciplines">
  <div><span class="eyebrow">01 / Close to the machine</span><h2>Local AI</h2><p>Models on your own hardware. Harnesses, inference, and the boundaries that make them usable.</p></div>
  <div><span class="eyebrow">02 / Built to be used</span><h2>Tools & evaluation</h2><p>Small, inspectable software. Tests that tell us what happened, not what the agent said happened.</p></div>
  <div><span class="eyebrow">03 / Sound meets picture</span><h2>Machine-made media</h2><p>Creative systems for moving images and sound. Human direction, explicit inputs, deliberate assembly.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="studio-wrap selected-section" id="selected-work"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">On the workbench</p><h2>Selected work</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/work">All work & notes ↗</a></div><SelectedWork /></section>
<section class="studio-wrap closing-note"><p class="eyebrow">The name is an ambition. Not a claim.</p><h2>Less magic.<br/><em>More making.</em></h2><div><p>Automation is useful when you can see what it did. We build, test, inspect, and keep the human decisions visible.</p><a class="text-link" href="/methodology">How we work ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/labs">Earlier lab notes ↗</a></div></section>
</main><Footer />
</Layout>
